      "references/authoritative-sources.md": "# Authoritative sources\n\n- Last verified: 2026-07-19\n- Review cadence: every 6 months\n- Refresh triggers: GSTools, PyKrige, or scikit-gstat major release\n\n## Canonical sources\n\n- [GSTools documentation](https://geostat-framework.readthedocs.io/projects/gstools/en/stable/) — covariance models, variograms, and kriging workflows.\n- [PyKrige documentation](https://geostat-framework.readthedocs.io/projects/pykrige/en/stable/) — ordinary, universal, and regression kriging APIs.\n- [scikit-gstat documentation](https://scikit-gstat.readthedocs.io/en/latest/) — empirical variogram estimation and diagnostics.\n\nTreat package defaults as implementation details, not methodological authority. Record estimator, model, fitting method, transform, distance units, and package version with every result.\n",
